.TH PDFANNEX-RESOLVER-FIXTURE 1
.SH NAME
pdfannex-resolver-fixture \- resolve pdfannex sources from a local fixture directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pdfannex-resolver-fixture
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pdfannex-resolver-fixture
implements Resolver Protocol 1 for the
.B fixture
scheme. It reads one JSON request from standard input and writes a JSON
response to standard output. It is normally invoked by the
.B pdfannex
CLI.
This is a minimal skeleton adapter shipped with the pdfannex-adapter-template
repository so that the template is runnable and testable; it is not a
production service adapter. It serves documents from a plain local directory
tree instead of a real network service.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
.B PDFANNEX_FIXTURE_ROOT
Required directory containing
.IR id / rev .pdf
files, for example
.IR PDFANNEX_FIXTURE_ROOT /memo/2.pdf .
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires
.BR texlua (1).
.SH SECURITY
The resolver does not access the network and reads only from the configured
root directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pdfannex (1)
